      "chunk_id": "7a5e3a20-eaf8-48e4-962f-0f0467690638",
      "content": "Retention Basics\n\nTeams should retain records according to the retention schedule in their approved system. This public policy does not include detailed legal retention rules or HR investigation outcomes.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-003",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "a3b6b2f3-1997-4c5d-a9de-2c0f6db5b950",
      "content": "Storage Rules\n\nInternal, Confidential, and Restricted data must be stored in approved company systems. Restricted data must not be downloaded to personal devices. Confidential data should not be stored in local folders unless there is a documented business need.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-003",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "7f43621b-e723-47b9-b347-6c633696ca67",
      "content": "Shipping and Return Rules\n\nEmployees leaving the company must return company equipment within 10 business days unless HR Admin approves an extension. Operations may provide a prepaid shipping label. Employees should not include personal items in return shipments.\n\nDamaged or missing equipment is reviewed by HR Admin and IT Admin before any payroll or final-pay action. This policy does not authorize payroll deductions by itself.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002011",
      "document_id": "OPS-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "c3bc1cb5-f4a8-4f8d-a8a2-3006d109d94f",
      "content": "Code of Conduct\n\nEmployees must communicate respectfully, protect confidential information, avoid harassment, and follow company security policies. Concerns about conduct should be reported to a manager, People Operations, or the confidential ethics channel.\n\nThe handbook does not include legal advice, salary bands, compensation formulas, or detailed HR investigation outcomes.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "c83e3811-1cf5-4479-899f-fd76bac98f5a",
      "content": "Vendor Onboarding\n\nNew vendors require a vendor intake request before work begins. The requester must provide vendor legal name, business purpose, expected start date, estimated annual spend, data access level, and contract owner.\n\n| Vendor Risk | Example | Required Review |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Low | Office supplies, training materials | Operations |\n| Moderate | Contractor with project files | Operations and Legal |\n| High | Vendor processing company or customer data | Operations, Legal, IT Admin |\n| Financial | Vendor paid through invoice or purchase order | Operations and Finance |\n\nVendors may not receive company data, customer data, credentials, or building access until required reviews are complete.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002011",
      "document_id": "OPS-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    }
  ],
